  "releaseNotes": "## v3.2.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v3.1.0:\n\n- Merge main, and take the whole ImGui suite to 3.31.0 ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Count the parameters with the collection assert ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [minor] Draw the inspector's properties as a property grid ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Bump the ktsu ImGui suite to 3.30.0 ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [patch] Take the ktsu ImGui suite at 3.28.0 ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Bump the ktsu ImGui suite to 3.27.0 ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
